## Third-Party Technologies

FlowViz uses the following browser APIs, which are built into all modern browsers:

- **Web Audio API** — W3C standard, freely available
  https://www.w3.org/TR/webaudio/

- **Canvas 2D** — HTML5 standard, freely available
  https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html

- **MediaRecorder API** — W3C standard, freely available
  https://www.w3.org/TR/mediastream-recording/

These are not bundled as separate dependencies. They are open web standards
implemented natively in modern browsers. No external libraries are used.

All visual effects, algorithms, and styles in FlowViz are original implementations.
